  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760350,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1st Division Manager: Take the Helm of English Football!\n\nStep into the boots of a manager in *1st Division Manager*, a captivating football management simulation for the Commodore Amiga. Choose your club from any of England's top four leagues and embark on a journey to glory!  \n\nThe game’s intuitive interface presents key information like your league position, rating, and finances right from the main menu.  Dive deep into team management via the database menu, where you can meticulously plan player training, analyze upcoming fixtures, and even edit your squad.  Negotiate transfers and secure vital loans through the telephone function, connecting you directly to the transfer market and the bank. Stay informed with detailed league tables accessible via the notebook icon. \n\nPrepare your squad and witness the action unfold in thrilling top-down match highlights.  Post-match, receive comprehensive reports detailing player injuries, results from rival games, and your club's weekly finances. Can you lead your team to victory and dominate the English football landscape?"
    },
